+Spec refs: REQ-SAMPLER-6639,
+SCENARIO-SAMPLER-6639-EXACT-AUTOREGRESSIVE-PARITY,
+SCENARIO-SAMPLER-6639-FAIL-CLOSED-NUMERICS,
+SCENARIO-SAMPLER-6639-SEALED-INDEPENDENT-EVIDENCE.
